@startuml
title Spring 事务与 Connection 交互时序图（DataSourceTransactionManager）

actor Client
participant "AOP Proxy" as Proxy
participant "TransactionInterceptor" as TI
participant "DataSourceTransactionManager" as TM
participant "TransactionSynchronizationManager\n(ThreadLocal)" as TSM
participant "DataSource" as DS
participant "Connection" as Conn
participant "DAO / JdbcTemplate" as DAO
database "Database" as DB

Client -> Proxy : 调用 @Transactional 方法
Proxy -> TI : invoke()

TI -> TM : getTransaction()

alt 当前线程无事务
  TM -> DS : getConnection()
  DS --> TM : Conn
  TM -> Conn : setAutoCommit(false)
  TM -> Conn : setTransactionIsolation(...) [可选]
  TM -> Conn : setReadOnly(true/false) [可选]
  TM -> TSM : bindResource(DS, Conn)\n绑定到当前线程
else 当前线程已有事务
  TM -> TSM : 复用已绑定 Conn
end

TI -> DAO : 执行业务 SQL
DAO -> TSM : 按 DS 查找线程绑定 Conn
TSM --> DAO : 返回同一个 Conn
DAO -> Conn : prepare/execute SQL
Conn -> DB : 执行语句
DB --> Conn : 返回结果
Conn --> DAO : 返回结果
DAO --> TI : 返回

alt 方法正常结束
  TI -> TM : commit()
  TM -> Conn : commit()
else 方法抛异常且命中回滚规则
  TI -> TM : rollback()
  TM -> Conn : rollback()
end

TM -> TSM : unbindResource(DS)
TM -> Conn : reset(readOnly/isolation/autocommit)
TM -> Conn : close() / 归还连接池
TI --> Proxy : 返回/抛异常
Proxy --> Client : 返回/抛异常
@enduml